{
  "_comment": "Student study paths through Danish MSc and BSc programmes, used for the student-perspective triangles. 'dedicated' = a quantum MSc whose structure is taken from the curriculum; 'path' = Danish Quantum Academy's example of a quantum-focused route through a broader MSc. Course roles: compulsory, restricted (restricted elective in the curriculum), elective (an elective a quantum-focused student would plausibly choose). The thesis profile is an assumption: a master's thesis in a quantum topic (CFQT gives a master's thesis in quantum information science as an example of C1 in area I). BSc course roles were checked against the 2026 curricula (KU studieordninger, DTU course base, AU programme structure, SDU study plans on odin.sdu.dk, AAU studieordninger); BSc paths assume a bachelor project in a quantum topic at level B2 in area I.",
